-- ProfileHandleInput — the input shape for attaching a social-media
-- handle to a profile: platform + handle + optional suspected flag +
-- validity window.
--
-- Static rows: none. The pre-flip inline-TS `defineSystemEntity` is GONE.
--
-- FM-retire-E1 Step 6 — LABEL-LESS entity; the bare `@codeName
-- "ProfileHandleInput"` trips the loader's identity-facet gate (see
-- ButtonPayload.fenel). `suspected: Maybe Bool` uses `Bool` (not the
-- `Boolean` opaque entity integration.enabled uses) — preserved verbatim,
-- they're distinct refs in the current oracle. No `Maybe ({})` field.

@entity
@codeName "ProfileHandleInput"
ProfileHandleInput = ProfileHandleInput platform: NonEmptyStr handle: NonEmptyStr suspected: Maybe Bool validFrom: Maybe String validTo: Maybe String
